# Certificate Templates

- Templates must be **JSON-based** — no HTML hardcoding
- Template variables must follow the `{{variable}}` format
- Always validate CSV headers against template variables before processing

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — hardcoded HTML
const cert = `<div style="...">${name}</div>`;

// ✅ GOOD — JSON template with variable placeholders
const template = { fields: [{ text: "{{name}}", x: 100, y: 200 }] };
```
